<title>NETHERLANDS: Aalberts says plans share split.</title>
<headline>Aalberts says plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch industrial holding Aalberts NV said on Wednesday it was planning a one for five share split.  </p>
<p>Aalberts Industries said the share split should increase turnover of its shares on the boarse.</p>
<p>The firm said the share split had nothing to do with its plans to acquire German Seppelfricke ArmaturenGroep.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
